<div id="2026-11-13-hk-slot-dish-title" class="cl-entry">
<h3>2026-11-13 — Day card titles the dish, not the slot</h3>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>What.</strong> A Health Kitchen day card whose plan entry has a recipe (or a typed meal name) now titles that dish and links to the meal plan. A slot with no owned dish keeps its label.</p>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>Why.</strong> The card said Breakfast or Supper even when tonight's dinner was already a named recipe. Marking the recurring template todo done would lock the template, not that day.</p>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>Files.</strong> <code>lib/Comserv/Util/HealthKitchen/MealSlots.pm</code>, <code>root/healthkitchen/_meal_slots.tt</code>, <code>t/hk_meal_slots.t</code></p>
</div>
